WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.098
Today we will recognise pulse and respectful listening. Our work connects with

00:00:05.098 --> 00:00:06.323
communities across Africa.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.400
Listen to a short local rhythm and count its pulses.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.931
Echo the pulse by tapping softly four times.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.192
Perform the pulse with a partner, starting and stopping together. Explain one

00:00:20.192 --> 00:00:23.520
respectful similarity or difference with another African example.
